000769r 2                       ; ---- the object list, cached between steps.
000769r 2                       ; LV_GRID/LV_BOBJ/LV_BNEXT and every O_TYPE are written only by level_init, so
000769r 2                       ; which objects the walk yields depends on nothing but the bucket rectangle --
000769r 2                       ; and that is unchanged on 77% of frames on L0 and 95% on L6.  So walk the grid
000769r 2                       ; only when the rectangle moves, and keep the deduped list to step through
