0010A5r 2                       ; nor anything they call, touches it -- so each reads and writes its own fields
0010A5r 2                       ; where they live: one cycle over a zero-page access, against seven to fetch a
0010A5r 2                       ; field and eight to put it back.  Every object field is 8-bit (tools/objaudit.py
0010A5r 2                       ; and tools/objfields.mjs are how that was established per handler).
